I thought it up, too!

20:12.250 --> 20:13.960
So her success would rub off.

20:13.960 --> 20:15.330
Cut that out.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.950
See you!

20:16.950 --> 20:18.140
Bye.

20:18.140 --> 20:19.640
Bye-bye.

20:21.390 --> 20:25.530
<i>Moka-nee always has the best 
timing for cheering me up.</i>

20:25.910 --> 20:30.040
<i>I don't have any confidence, 
and I can't be like her...</i>

20:30.300 --> 20:33.680
...but this is where it counts. 
I'll make it entertaining, or else!

20:35.460 --> 20:36.280
<i>Huh?</i>

20:36.280 --> 20:39.170
Th-This feeling... <i>Uh oh!</i>

20:41.680 --> 20:42.790
Yes?

20:42.790 --> 20:44.580
Uh, it's me.

20:44.580 --> 20:50.440
So, hopefully it's my imagination, 
but are you feeling bad?

20:56.840 --> 20:59.690
Momoka-san is a good person.

20:59.690 --> 21:00.850
That's true.

21:00.850 --> 21:02.920
Is this about her?

21:02.920 --> 21:09.870
When it occurred to me that she 
must hold a special place for you,

21:09.870 --> 21:12.740
I felt a sense of gloom in my heart.

21:12.740 --> 21:14.910
Well, I owe her a lot.

21:14.910 --> 21:18.760
But she's married. There's no 
need for weird suspicions.

21:18.760 --> 21:23.410
But I won't calm down unless
 I find out what this gloom is!

21:24.250 --> 21:26.630
Am I unhappy with your relationship?

21:26.630 --> 21:31.130
Why? You're both good-natured.
 I have no reason to dislike her.

21:32.510 --> 21:36.660
Am I... jealous?

21:37.790 --> 21:39.050
Love?

21:41.390 --> 21:46.830
Kuga-san, I'm in... love with you.

21:50.870 --> 21:53.140
G-Goshiki-san! Uh...

21:53.140 --> 21:54.320
Wait!

21:54.320 --> 21:57.670
For tonight I want to savor 
this wonderful feeling!

21:58.090 --> 22:01.840
Please don't say anything. Good night!

22:05.930 --> 22:07.610
This is love!

22:08.690 --> 22:09.880
Adorable—

22:09.880 --> 22:12.550
No, wait! I need to calm down!

22:16.060 --> 22:27.650
A long red thread stretching 
into the distance

22:27.650 --> 22:38.800
Meeting you, even if it meant having 
to cross hundreds of light-years

22:38.800 --> 22:45.480
Maybe I'll slowly get used to

22:45.480 --> 22:52.390
The two of us going out to have fun

22:52.390 --> 23:02.230
A tug on my arm, by the bond 
that was formed that day

23:02.230 --> 23:08.090
A little at a time, we've 
come closer together

23:08.090 --> 23:12.880
More smiles for us

23:12.880 --> 23:25.690
That place I first learned of, and 
the shops we'll visit again tomorrow

23:25.690 --> 23:31.650
They'll all be part of these lovely days

23:31.650 --> 23:38.490
Looking forward to it, good night

23:46.210 --> 23:48.160
What do you want to do 
if it's a sunny weekend?

23:48.160 --> 23:49.160
The zoo.

23:49.160 --> 23:51.270
Nice! What about if it rains?

23:51.270 --> 23:52.340
The zoo!

23:52.340 --> 23:55.440
What if it's all crazy and stormy?

23:55.440 --> 23:56.470
The zoo!

23:55.910 --> 23:59.900
<b>Episode 4</b>

23:55.910 --> 23:59.900
<b><b>Weather Conditions with the Princess</b></b>

23:56.470 --> 23:58.390
We'll just have to hope for sun!
